    schema:description "This is what makes your position special Full-stack software development based on Docker, Node.js and MongoDB Set your own focus: Backend, Frontend, DevOps, Security, Data Modeling, Development tools Component responsibility: from technical design to development to CI/CD If you take responsibility, you also get freedom of decision Co-determination: Get involved in the strategic direction, introduce new technologies, present interesting topics in our TechTalks or workshops Close cooperation with our Development Team, with Product Management, Quality Assurance and Customer Care The position is also available on a part-time basis This is what makes you special Completed studies or training in the field of computer science, mathematics, physics or other natural sciences Solid development experience, including JavaScript and TypeScript in full-stack development, and experience with AI Experience with large repositories and an empathetic approach to working as part of a team A structured and goal-oriented way of working with very high quality awareness Strong teamwork skills and the ability to successfully collaborate in an agile environment Ideally, industry knowledge in the e-health sector, medical technology or physician information systems/practice software Ability to learn new content quickly and independently Very good German and English language skills This is what makes working at Doc Cirrus special Experience a culture of communication and feedback: Become part of an open and approachable interaction with regular exchange meetings and team events Stay in balance: Flexible working hours and 30 days of vacation have been given since day one of our founding. Choose between 3 work models: remote, hybrid or office Learn from each other: A well-structured onboarding and our buddy system support you during your starting phase Attractive in the long term: We encourage part-time work and offer you a competitive salary as well as a permanent employment contract Participate in our success: Thanks to out attractive participation model, including a share option program and joint profit sharing, every team member benefits from our Doc Cirrus story Arrive safely: We subsidize your Job Ticket dependig on the chosen woking model Personal growth: We support you in your development through regular training and continuing education Your contact person Would you like to change the healthcare system together with us? Then Nici and Antonia are looking forward to your application and maybe you will soon become part of our team! https://www.doc-cirrus.com/ueber-doc-cirrus/karriere#jobs Please tell us your earliest possible starting date and your salary expectation. We would be happy to receive a short cover letter or letter of motivation. We value diversity and therefore welcome all applications - regardless of gender, nationality, ethnic and social origin, religion/belief, disability, age, sexual orientation and identity. Application Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
