    schema:datePosted "2026-09-03"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "This isn’t your regular job. Almedia is a place where those who want to push harder can accelerate their careers faster than anywhere else. We’re aiming to become Germany’s second bootstrapped unicorn. Almedia is already Europe’s #3 fastest-growing company in 2025 (FT1000). We are building the future of marketing by rewarding our community of over 70 million users for engaging with our advertisers’ products. We are offering a new way to acquire users for the biggest companies in the world. At Almedia, we’re looking for an Organic Growth Content Marketer to help scale our organic acquisition engine across SEO, GEO, ASO, and CRO. This is a hands-on, cross-functional growth role focused on driving sustainable user acquisition through technical SEO, content optimization, experimentation, and AI-powered workflows. We’re looking for someone analytical, execution-focused, and comfortable operating across multiple organic growth disciplines. Organic Growth Content Marketer Salary range: €60,000-70,000/annum What You'll Do 🎯 Write, edit, and publish high-quality content at scale — articles, guides, landing page copy, and store listings across SEO, GEO, and ASO Execute hands-on across the organic stack: on-page optimizations, content refreshes, internal linking, and ASO updates Create/optimize content based on search intent, ranking opportunities, and conversion potential Concept new landing pages and improve existing ones — structure, copy, CTAs — guided by a clear understanding of the full funnel, from first visit to signup and first completed task Shape strategic decisions together with the team — our narrative, how we present the brand, and how we show up across the whole organic spectrum: search, AI answers, and app stores Spot opportunities in rankings, citations, and funnel data — pitch your angle, then build it yourself Build scalable content workflows using AI tools and automation, together with the wider growth team What You'll Bring 💡 3+ years in SEO, content, or organic growth — with published work you're proud to show Exceptional writing and editing skills in English — fast, versatile, and publishable across formats A generalist's grasp of how SEO, GEO, ASO, and CRO work together — and the ability to execute in each, not just advise An analytical mindset: you bring data to content decisions and let performance settle debates Experience growing organic traffic and conversion-driven signups through content and landing pages — you think in funnels, not just pages Comfortable working with AI tools and modern growth workflows A collaborative working style — you thrive on feedback and close teamwork, and reliably bring your pieces over the finish line What Makes You a Great Fit 🌟 Experience with tools like: Ahrefs / Semrush GA4 & Google Search Console AppTweak Headless CMS (Strapi, WordPress, or similar) AI writing & research tools (Claude, ChatGPT, etc.) Build & automation tools for custom workflows (Cursor, Lovable, Antigravity, Railway, etc.) Why Almedia? 🎁 Own Our Growth: We offer all Berlin-based employees equity in Almedia to truly be a part of our success. Scale With Almedia: Grow alongside a startup that has been profitable from day one. Central Berlin Office: Work from a fully-stocked modern office built for collaboration, accessible from all around Berlin. Other Benefits: Transport subsidy, breakfasts and lunches, language learning, Urban Sports Club, and more. We believe in fostering talent, evaluating all skill levels during the hiring process, and providing a clear path for growth. Almedia is an equal opportunity employer. We embrace and celebrate diversity, and encourage individuals from all backgrounds to apply. Compensation: €60K – €70K • €60K – €70K Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:employmentType "Full Time" ;
