    schema:description "<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A career driven by you. </span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:257}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=\"p1\">Join our Product Management team in designing and managing the product vision. You’ll work independently, setting the&nbsp;north star, defining the scope, executing freely, and leading from behind. Consider it your own, mini-start-up. You’ll work&nbsp;untethered, focused on the user, with modern tools in a dynamic environment.</p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What you’ll do:</span></strong></p> <ul> <li class=\"p1\">Define vision as well as business goals for the Engagement product area within the AutoScout24 buyer experience, focusing on driving user activation, engagement, and retention and translate them into a strategy and concrete product streams</li> <li class=\"p1\">Develop a product roadmap and milestones that reflect expected engagement outcomes, using data insights and experimentation to inform prioritization</li> <li class=\"p1\">Align priorities across the product organization with stakeholders, ensuring your work supports broader company goals</li> <li class=\"p1\">Own the end-to-end product lifecycle in your cross-functional team: deeply understand the customer, develop hypotheses, validate ideas through A/B testing, and iterate based on results. Collaborate to craft culture with our top tier leadership team while mentoring and coaching PMs and those around you</li> <li class=\"p1\">Establish, support, and ensure compliance of company product management methods and tools</li> <li class=\"p1\">Define success metrics around engagement and retention, and regularly communicate performance, learnings, and impact across the organization</li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What you’ll bring:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li class=\"p1\">Digital product management experience, preferably in Marketplaces or eCommerce</li> <li class=\"p1\">Strong customer focus with proven track record of building products from MVP to “world-class” using insights from tracking, user testing and A/B tests</li> <li class=\"p1\">Ideally knowledge in conversion rate optimisation (CRO) as well as testing frameworks and tools</li> <li class=\"p1\">Very good analytical skills with the ability to use data to backup ideas and assumptions, develop insights and recommendations and define and measure success metrics</li> <li class=\"p1\">Self-management, negotiation technique, conflict management and strategic thinking</li> <li class=\"p1\">Strong business knowledge and team development experience</li> <li class=\"p1\">Extensive know-how of common product management tools and knowledge of target groups</li> <li class=\"p1\">Product and cross-departmental entrepreneurial thinking and acting</li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A culture of growth&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
