    schema:description "<section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-e5001439-4742-4d2b-ad09-b6c2bbb23a94 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Our company</h2> </div> </div> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <p class=\"text-element-body_text\">Paradox Cat GmbH is a specialist software development partner in the area of real-time graphics from Munich, Germany. As a partner and supplier of various premium automotive manufacturers, we support graphical interface development for high-end in car cluster instruments and infotainment systems. In addition to this, PARADOX CAT GmbH has increasingly participated in Proof of Concept projects and feasibility studies in the Human Machine Interaction (HMI) spectrum. Here, we focus on the implementation of new emerging technologies and their usability and implementation in the car of the future.</p> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-d9f9b53d-d573-4479-b959-19d63606bc17 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Senior Embedded Platform &amp; Linux Engineer FREELANCER (f/m/d) - Munich</h2> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">You will:</h2> </div> </div> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <p></p> <div> <ul> <li>Develop and integrate Embedded C/C++ software for ARM-based platforms</li> <li>Bring up target hardware and integrate Yocto-based Board Support Packages, including bootloader, Linux Kernel, Device Tree, drivers and peripheral interfaces</li> <li>Create and maintain Yocto layers, BitBake recipes and reproducible build, flashing and deployment environments</li> <li>Debug complex hardware and software issues using GDB, JTAG, logs, traces and Linux performance tools</li> <li>Analyze system performance, memory usage, startup behavior and I/O bottlenecks</li> <li>Support display, GPU, network and system integration in close collaboration with software, graphics and QA engineers</li> <li>Coordinate technical topics with customers, hardware suppliers and platform vendors, document results and share knowledge within the team</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-a3917bb8-a1f3-4b6e-b775-ce74fa0c6207 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">You have:</h2> <p></p> <div> <ul> <li>A degree in computer science, electrical engineering, embedded systems, a comparable qualification, or equivalent experience</li> <li>Several years of professional embedded software development experience with strong Embedded C and Embedded C++ skills</li> <li>Practical experience with ARM-based SoCs or microcontrollers, board bring-up and hardware-near development</li> <li>Strong knowledge of Embedded Linux, Yocto, BitBake, OpenEmbedded, Device Tree, BSP integration and cross-compilation</li> <li>Experience with Linux Kernel configuration, device drivers and bootloaders such as U-Boot</li> <li>Practical target-hardware debugging experience using GDB and JTAG, SWD or comparable technologies</li> <li>A structured approach to root-cause analysis and experience with Git and agile development</li> <li>An excellent standard of written and spoken English</li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-454fed82-f3fe-4178-8429-3b491e2051f9 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Nice to have:</h2> </div> </div> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <p></p> <div> <ul> <li>Experience with NXP i.MX platforms, ideally i.MX 95, heterogeneous Cortex-A/Cortex-M systems or vendor-specific BSPs and SDKs</li> <li>Knowledge of FreeRTOS, secure boot, Ethernet, TSN, IEEE 1588 or embedded performance tools such as perf, ftrace and kgdb</li> <li>Experience integrating display controllers, GPU drivers, OpenGL ES, EGL or Vulkan</li> <li>Experience with CI/CD, automated image creation, flashing and deployment</li> <li>Automotive, industrial, commercial vehicle or functional safety experience</li> <li>Knowledge of written and spoken German</li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> <p>#LI-Hybrid #LI-MM1</p> Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
