    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "senior-functional-safety-autosar-classic-software-engineer-freelancer-munich-ingolstadt-bavaria-munchen-bavaria-15960" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-09-03"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-e5001439-4742-4d2b-ad09-b6c2bbb23a94 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Our company</h2> </div> </div> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <p class=\"text-element-body_text\">Paradox Cat GmbH is a specialist software development partner in the area of real-time graphics from Munich, Germany. As a partner and supplier of various premium automotive manufacturers, we support graphical interface development for high-end in car cluster instruments and infotainment systems. In addition to this, PARADOX CAT GmbH has increasingly participated in Proof of Concept projects and feasibility studies in the Human Machine Interaction (HMI) spectrum. Here, we focus on the implementation of new emerging technologies and their usability and implementation in the car of the future.</p> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-d9f9b53d-d573-4479-b959-19d63606bc17 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Senior Functional Safety &amp; AUTOSAR Classic Software Engineer FREELANCER (f/m/d) - Munich</h2> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">You will:</h2> </div> </div> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <ul class=\"text-element-body_text\"> <li> <div>Develop and integrate safety-relevant Embedded C application software in an AUTOSAR Classic environment</div> </li> <li> <div>Design and implement Software Components and interfaces between ASW, RTE and BSW</div> </li> <li> <div>Translate system and safety requirements into software architecture, requirements and implementation concepts</div> </li> <li> <div>Implement QM and safety separation, safety monitoring, fault handling and safe-state behavior</div> </li> <li> <div>Support safety-relevant input, touch and display functionality on embedded target platforms</div> </li> <li> <div>Maintain traceability between requirements, architecture, implementation and verification</div> </li> <li> <div>Prepare technical evidence for safety reviews and support integration, testing, change-impact analysis and defect resolution</div> </li> <li> <div>Collaborate with platform, system, software and QA engineers and share AUTOSAR and safety knowledge within the team</div> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-a3917bb8-a1f3-4b6e-b775-ce74fa0c6207 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">You have:</h2> <ul> <li class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">A degree in computer science, electrical engineering, automotive engineering, embedded systems, a comparable qualification, or equivalent experience</li> <li class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Several years of professional embedded software development experience with strong Embedded C skills</li> <li class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Practical project experience with AUTOSAR Classic, ASW or SWC development, RTE, BSW interfaces and ARXML</li> <li class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Experience with at least one established AUTOSAR development or configuration toolchain</li> <li class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Strong practical knowledge of ISO 26262 at software level and ASIL-oriented development</li> <li class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Experience deriving and implementing Software Safety RequirementsPractical experience with QM and safety separation, safety monitoring, fault handling and safe-state mechanisms</li> <li class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Knowledge of safety-oriented software architecture, static analysis, structured reviews and verification</li> <li class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">An evidence-based approach to technical documentation and an excellent standard of written and spoken English</li> </ul> </div> </section> <section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-454fed82-f3fe-4178-8429-3b491e2051f9 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div> <h2 class=\"text-element-header_text-2\">Nice to have:</h2> </div> </div> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <ul> <li> <div>Experience with ASIL-B, safety islands, dedicated safety controllers or heterogeneous multicore platforms</div> </li> <li> <div>Knowledge of Freedom from Interference, memory and timing protection, MISRA C, watchdogs and End-to-End protection</div> </li> <li> <div>Experience with FMEA, FTA, FMEDA, HARA support or safety-case preparation</div> </li> <li> <div>Experience with Vector DaVinci, Elektrobit tresos, ETAS ISOLAR, CANoe or CANalyzer</div> </li> <li> <div>Knowledge of DEM, DCM, UDS, PduR, COM or related AUTOSAR modules</div> </li> <li> <div>Knowledge of Automotive SPICE, IEC 61508, Performance Level or SIL-related development</div> </li> <li> <div>Experience with safety-relevant HMI, touch or display functions and NXP i.MX or comparable ARM platforms</div> </li> <li> <div>Adaptive AUTOSAR knowledge in addition to AUTOSAR Classic</div> </li> <li> <div>Knowledge of written and spoken German</div> </li> </ul> </div> </section> <section class=\"container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-cca97dd4-37b4-4d42-931b-fbcca7f861c4 section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title\" data-v-51f33a98=\"\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\"> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\">&nbsp;</div> <div class=\"text-element editable-element editable-text-element\" data-v-b92e6724=\"\">&nbsp;</div> </section> <p>#LI-Hybrid #LI-MM1</p> Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
